1
00:00:43,231 --> 00:00:46,555
=Born Again=

2
00:00:46,555 --> 00:00:49,558
=Episode 17=

3
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:51,320
Your mother has many hidden issues.

4
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:53,160
Her heart and liver are both weak.

5
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:58,200
Doctor, is there any way to treat them?

6
00:00:58,200 --> 00:00:59,680
First, she needs to rest.

7
00:01:00,240 --> 00:01:01,240
What's your job?

8
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:04,520
I-I work several jobs.

9
00:01:04,680 --> 00:01:05,680
That won't do.

10
00:01:05,720 --> 00:01:07,120
Your body is waving red flags.

11
00:01:07,120 --> 00:01:09,120
If this keeps up,
your body will give out.

12
00:01:09,160 --> 00:01:10,160
I'm fine.

13
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:11,160
Take care of yourself.

14
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:12,400
Thank you, Doctor.

15
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:19,920
Mom, you can't keep
pushing yourself like this.

16
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:22,280
It'll ruin your health.

17
00:01:24,360 --> 00:01:26,800
Xiaotang, I'm just too tired.

18
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:29,480
It's nothing. Don't worry.

19
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:32,560
You really didn't have to
bring me here for a checkup.

20
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:35,000
That's a lot of money.

21
00:01:35,320 --> 00:01:37,240
Mom, listen to me.

22
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:39,200
If you don't, I'll...

23
00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:40,360
I'll drop out of school.

24
00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:41,560
Promise me.

25
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:45,560
Okay, I promise.

26
00:01:47,360 --> 00:01:50,000
But as you know,

27
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:52,760
I'm the only one
making money in this family.

28
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:54,440
Your dad...

29
00:01:57,040 --> 00:01:58,040
Mom,

30
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:00,480
why don't you divorce him?

31
00:02:08,440 --> 00:02:10,560
How could I not want to divorce him?

32
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:12,680
But every time

33
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,120
I mention it,

34
00:02:14,920 --> 00:02:16,280
he beats me half to death.

35
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:18,280
I've consulted lawyers.

36
00:02:20,040 --> 00:02:21,840
Even if I file for divorce,

37
00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:23,480
do you think that scoundrel

38
00:02:24,760 --> 00:02:27,160
would leave us alone after getting out?

39
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:29,960
He threatened me,

40
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:32,840
saying even if we divorce,

41
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:35,720
he'll haunt us for the rest of our lives

42
00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:37,680
and kill us.

43
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:42,920
I'm not afraid of dying.

44
00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:44,240
What I fear most

45
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:46,760
is him hurting you.

46
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:50,000
You'll let him feed off you forever?

47
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:52,880
My life

48
00:02:53,720 --> 00:02:55,680
has no turning back now.

49
00:02:58,760 --> 00:03:00,160
But I want you to be happy.

50
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:03,400
Don't end up like me.

51
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:08,640
Mom, don't worry.

52
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:10,960
You will have a happy ending.

53
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:14,720
I'll make sure you get it.

54
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:24,880
Mom, I want to eat your braised pork.

55
00:03:24,880 --> 00:03:26,480
I haven't had it in ages.

56
00:03:26,720 --> 00:03:27,720
I'll cook it tonight.

57
00:03:27,720 --> 00:03:28,720
Gu Xiaotang.

58
00:03:31,920 --> 00:03:33,240
Your father owes me money.

59
00:03:34,040 --> 00:03:35,240
When do you plan to pay it?

60
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:37,840
What does Su Dawei's debt
have to do with me?

61
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:39,080
I know the rules.

62
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:41,600
I don't want to be hard
on a girl like you.

63
00:03:41,600 --> 00:03:42,600
But

64
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:45,640
you hit my girl, Lin Wei, first.

65
00:03:45,920 --> 00:03:47,960
And your dad owes me money and ran off.

66
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:50,840
The debt must be settled.

67
00:03:53,720 --> 00:03:56,080
How about you tell me what to do?

68
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:57,440
What do you want?

69
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:08,880
Lu Qingyuan?

70
00:04:11,600 --> 00:04:12,600
You know each other?

71
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,360
How would I know her, Ms. Lei?

72
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:15,920
Leave it to me. I'll handle it.

73
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:17,680
Pay back what you owe.

74
00:04:17,680 --> 00:04:18,760
It's only right.

75
00:04:18,960 --> 00:04:21,200
Pay up now,
or I'll chop off your finger.

76
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:24,680
Chop off my finger?

77
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:26,600
Lu Qingyuan, is that all you've got?

78
00:04:26,880 --> 00:04:29,040
Following others around like a lapdog

79
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:30,800
and biting whoever you're told?

80
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:32,080
No wonder your mom dislikes you.

81
00:04:32,520 --> 00:04:33,520
That's nonsense.

82
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:36,240
When you were chasing me, you said

83
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:38,360
you started your own business as a kid.

84
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:40,640
It turns out you're just a street thug.

85
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:43,000
You got a death wish?

86
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:45,720
What are you doing?
In broad daylight? Let go!

87
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:46,920
Lu Qingyuan, let me go!

88
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:49,920
Ms. Lei, didn't you say there are rules

89
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:51,000
and you respect rules?

90
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:52,120
Let go of my daughter!

91
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:53,120
Enough.

92
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:55,600
Are you okay?

93
00:04:58,640 --> 00:04:59,640
Are you hurt?

94
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:02,880
So? Got something to say?

95
00:05:02,880 --> 00:05:04,200
Yeah, I hit Lin Wei.

96
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:06,880
But Su Dawei's debt is his own problem.

97
00:05:06,880 --> 00:05:07,880
My mom's not part of it.

98
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:09,920
I'll go with you.

99
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:12,160
No.

100
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:13,160
Mom, don't worry.

101
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,160
They won't do anything to me.

102
00:05:15,520 --> 00:05:16,760
Go home and rest.

103
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:19,520
I promise you'll see me
tomorrow morning.

104
00:05:19,520 --> 00:05:21,480
How long can we keep hiding?

105
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:24,600
This time, I'll settle everything
once and for all.

106
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,760
Are you done?

107
00:05:32,760 --> 00:05:35,400
Gu Xiaotang, my patience
is running thin.

108
00:05:35,840 --> 00:05:38,120
About your dad's debt,
plus what you owe Lin Wei,

109
00:05:38,960 --> 00:05:39,960
what will you do?

110
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:41,640
What will I do?

111
00:05:42,520 --> 00:05:43,520
He already said it.

112
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:45,600
One finger off from me,

113
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:46,600
and we're square.

114
00:05:46,960 --> 00:05:48,320
Don't think we won't do it.

115
00:05:48,320 --> 00:05:49,480
Who are you trying to scare?

116
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:51,720
I know you dare to do it.

117
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:53,000
In this line of work,

118
00:05:53,200 --> 00:05:54,600
who hasn't spilled some blood?

119
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:56,760
A finger for peace and quiet?

120
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:58,120
I think it's worth it.

121
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:00,160
I've got ten right here.

122
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:01,840
Enough to cover the interest.

123
00:06:02,400 --> 00:06:03,520
Is one enough?

124
00:06:03,520 --> 00:06:05,680
If not, take another?

125
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:08,160
So generous?

126
00:06:09,520 --> 00:06:10,520
Who'll do it?

127
00:06:10,520 --> 00:06:11,520
I'll do it.

128
00:06:19,200 --> 00:06:20,400
Tough talk, huh?

129
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:23,280
Which finger do you want to lose first?

130
00:06:25,760 --> 00:06:28,720
No answer? Then I'll pick for you.

131
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:30,760
Lu Qingyuan.

132
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:34,880
It's too late to beg for mercy now.

133
00:06:35,280 --> 00:06:36,480
Think carefully.

134
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:38,320
If you chop off my finger,

135
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:40,800
only you will have blood on your hands.

136
00:06:41,440 --> 00:06:42,520
I'll be fine.

137
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:44,200
But when my mom calls the police,

138
00:06:44,560 --> 00:06:46,800
the police will only arrest you.

139
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:50,280
I remember your mom is in poor health.

140
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:52,440
If you go to prison,

141
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:54,280
what will happen to her?

142
00:06:58,720 --> 00:07:00,720
Hurry up. Get on with it.

143
00:07:05,440 --> 00:07:07,440
Useless. Get lost.

144
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:11,040
What?

145
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:14,160
You think calling the cops scares me?

146
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:17,240
You think I frighten that easily?

147
00:07:23,760 --> 00:07:26,400
Having you do it personally is my honor.

148
00:07:26,960 --> 00:07:28,120
If word gets out,

149
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:30,040
people will know the famous Ms. Lei

150
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:33,920
chopped off a high school girl's finger
over a petty debt.

151
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:37,160
That's quite the reputation,

152
00:07:38,960 --> 00:07:42,440
much more unique
than your legendary solo heroics.

153
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:45,840
From now on, when people mention you,

154
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:47,360
they'll only think of you

155
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:51,800
as the woman
who picks on a little girl's finger.

156
00:07:57,840 --> 00:07:58,840
Get lost.

157
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:01,160
But

158
00:08:02,280 --> 00:08:04,680
you still owe every cent of that debt.

159
00:08:09,640 --> 00:08:12,760
- (No, I have to settle the debt.)
- Why aren't you leaving?

160
00:08:12,760 --> 00:08:14,640
(Or they'll come after us
sooner or later.)

161
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:18,760
You told me to leave, so I'm leaving.

162
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:21,440
But before I go,
let me make something clear.

163
00:08:21,440 --> 00:08:23,160
My dad owes you money.

164
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:24,360
A debt must be repaid,

165
00:08:24,360 --> 00:08:25,360
and it's only natural.

166
00:08:25,400 --> 00:08:27,400
I accept that debt.

167
00:08:28,200 --> 00:08:29,200
You accept it?

168
00:08:30,840 --> 00:08:31,840
How?

169
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:33,160
If I say

170
00:08:33,160 --> 00:08:35,160
I can not only pay back
the principal and interest

171
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:39,480
but also let you make
ten times more, no,

172
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:40,480
a hundred times more,

173
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:41,600
so much

174
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:45,120
you could expand this pool hall
several times over

175
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:47,360
or

176
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:51,960
get into a more respectable
and profitable business,

177
00:08:51,960 --> 00:08:52,960
will you believe me?

178
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:58,320
Listen up, everyone.

179
00:08:59,280 --> 00:09:01,560
This little brat
is hallucinating from fear.

180
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:05,160
As for Lin Wei getting hit,

181
00:09:06,400 --> 00:09:08,480
Ms. Lei, by street rules,

182
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:09,960
if you lose a fight,

183
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:11,800
you either train harder and fight back

184
00:09:11,800 --> 00:09:12,800
or accept defeat.

185
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:15,480
There's no reason for me
to pay compensation.

186
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:16,880
It's her own fault

187
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,040
for being weak.

188
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:23,320
Fine.

189
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:26,880
But about letting me make money,

190
00:09:27,720 --> 00:09:28,720
how can I trust you?

191
00:09:36,762 --> 00:09:39,480
(Haishan Red Star Textile Factory
Accident Causes Heavy Casualties)

192
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:40,960
The boiler

193
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:43,200
at Red Star Textile Factory
will explode in three days,

194
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:44,200
and people will get hurt.

195
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:47,000
You just need to evacuate everyone
before the explosion.

196
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:49,920
The factory will reward you handsomely.

197
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:53,000
Wait, this sounds more and more like
you're messing with me.

198
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,240
How can I trust you?

199
00:09:55,200 --> 00:09:58,280
Because I know things most people don't.

200
00:09:59,560 --> 00:10:00,720
Like

201
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:04,960
him.

202
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:07,840
Ms. Lei, ask him.

203
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:09,320
Before today,

204
00:10:09,920 --> 00:10:10,920
has he ever seen me?

205
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:14,320
Ms. Lei, I don't know her.

206
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:15,320
She's crazy.

207
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:17,600
You don't know me, right?

208
00:10:18,560 --> 00:10:19,560
Lu Qingyuan,

209
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:21,400
on your left butt cheek,

210
00:10:21,400 --> 00:10:24,440
is there a birthmark shaped like a map?

211
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:30,480
No, Ms. Lei.

212
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:33,080
No.

213
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:35,880
Check it.

214
00:10:43,760 --> 00:10:45,040
Hold still.

215
00:10:48,680 --> 00:10:49,680
Get down.

216
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:54,000
Don't move.

217
00:10:55,520 --> 00:10:56,520
Don't move.

218
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:07,480
Ms. Lei, look.
There really is a birthmark.

219
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:10,960
(Lu Qingyuan,)

220
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:12,720
(since you're still haunting me,)

221
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:15,440
(I'll find every way there is
to make you suffer.)

222
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:21,400
You brat, you're quite something.

223
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:24,680
Fine. I'll give you three days.

224
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:27,720
If what you said
about Red Star Textile Factory is true,

225
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:29,080
we'll make money together.

226
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,920
If you're messing with me,

227
00:11:32,560 --> 00:11:33,720
you'll be sorry.

228
00:12:04,762 --> 00:12:08,118
♪The face deep in the heart♪

229
00:12:08,310 --> 00:12:10,772
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

230
00:12:12,147 --> 00:12:15,847
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

231
00:12:16,058 --> 00:12:18,498
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

232
00:12:18,645 --> 00:12:21,017
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

233
00:12:21,167 --> 00:12:23,924
♪Persistently guarding,
endlessly cycling♪

234
00:12:23,924 --> 00:12:26,245
♪Even for just a second♪

235
00:12:27,590 --> 00:12:31,053
♪If raindrops flow backward
into the sky♪

236
00:12:31,181 --> 00:12:33,030
♪And sunlight reverses♪

237
00:12:33,030 --> 00:12:36,500
♪As the sun rises and sets,
we reunite with yesterday♪

238
00:12:36,856 --> 00:12:38,930
♪I'll build a dream with you♪

239
00:12:39,432 --> 00:12:42,841
♪Upon the ruins, spring breeze arrives♪

240
00:12:43,098 --> 00:12:48,310
♪Even if there's no end,
I won't regret the start♪

241
00:12:49,564 --> 00:12:52,129
♪Eternity like a day, rushing to you♪

242
00:12:52,171 --> 00:12:55,624
♪You don't need to recognize my eyes♪

243
00:12:56,201 --> 00:12:59,164
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

244
00:12:59,909 --> 00:13:02,517
♪A day like a lifetime, rushing to you♪

245
00:13:02,517 --> 00:13:06,140
♪You don't need to remember my name♪

246
00:13:06,610 --> 00:13:10,666
♪I'll be the dawn you haven't seen♪
